{"id":"2db01209d2aa1bcd","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-deduction-system.md","title":"Hilbert Deduction System","display":"df-deduction-system — Hilbert Deduction System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-deduction-system","aliases":["17-df-deduction-system"],"display":"df-deduction-system — Hilbert Deduction System","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-ax-propositional-logic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-deduction-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-deduction-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deduction-system — Hilbert Deduction System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44a4dc83ba48fed8\" href=\"?note=44a4dc83ba48fed8\" title=\"17-ax-propositional-logic\">17-ax-propositional-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L)\\)</span> (propositional axiom instances, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44a4dc83ba48fed8\" href=\"?note=44a4dc83ba48fed8\" title=\"17-ax-propositional-logic\">17-ax-propositional-logic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span> (rule arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (candidate axiom set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rule}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rule}_L\\)</span> (candidate rule set)</li>\n<li>每条规则是“有限前提元组与结论”的实例对组成的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_L\\)</span> 为所有这类规则的集合，以下定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSystems}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSystems}(L)\\)</span> (class of Hilbert systems, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}_L\\)</span> (modus-ponens rule, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L)\">\\(\\mathcal H_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L)\\)</span> (propositional Hilbert system, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Rule}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Form}_L^m\\times\\mathrm{Form}_L\\bigr)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HilbertSystems}(L)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathcal H=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}):\n\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L\\land\n\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rule}_L\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{MP}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\langle\\varphi,\\varphi\\to\\psi\\rangle,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L),\\{\\mathrm{MP}_L\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Rule}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Form}_L^m\\times\\mathrm{Form}_L\\bigr)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HilbertSystems}(L)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathcal H=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}):\n\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L\\land\n\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rule}_L\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{MP}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\langle\\varphi,\\varphi\\to\\psi\\rangle,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L),\\{\\mathrm{MP}_L\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>区分一条推理规则与该规则的某个实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}_L\\)</span> 是实例对的集合，故确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_L\\)</span> 的成员，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathrm{MP}_L\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathrm{MP}_L\\}\\)</span> 才是规则集。本节点只给出一般 Hilbert 系统框架和命题子系统；原书 §1.3 的完整一阶系统还需要量词、等词公理及概括规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-ax-propositional-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44a4dc83ba48fed8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-ax-propositional-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ (first-order language, see [[17-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ (formula set, see [[17-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-ax-propositional-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44a4dc83ba48fed8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L)$ (propositional axiom instances, see [[17-ax-propositional-logic]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Prop}}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rule}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rule}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hi